    "result_text": "The full suite passes: **68 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors, BUILD SUCCESS**.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `ownerSegment` derived field for owners.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `ownerSegment` string property to the `Owner` schema, documenting the `<TIER>_<AREA>` format and its four possible values. The `OwnerDto` is generated from this spec at build time.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added the MapStruct mapping and a new `ownerSegment(Owner)` default method:\n   - **TIER** = `PREMIUM` when `membershipLevel(owner) >= 3`, else `STANDARD` (reusing the existing `membershipLevel` derivation).\n   - **AREA** = `METRO` when `locality(owner)` is a known region (`NSW`, `VIC`, `QLD` via a new `METRO_REGIONS` set), else `REGIONAL` (reusing the existing `locality` derivation).\n\nThis composes cleanly on the existing derived fields, so the segment stays consistent with the owner's membership level and locality. The new `Cp55Tests` pass, and all 68 tests remain green.",
